  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 57a8e05a8a1d4451e9081ab70ab1f576, type: 3}
  itemDescription: "Hydrogen Technologies Institute: This institute is devoted to
    the emerging hydrogen economy. Its mission covers hydrogen production (especially
    green hydrogen via electrolysis), hydrogen storage and transport, and fuel cell
    technology. Focus areas include improving electrolyzers (to produce hydrogen
    from water using solar/wind power), developing safe hydrogen storage materials
    (like metal hydrides or high-pressure tanks), and fuel cells for power and transportation.
    The institute supports Saudi initiatives (like Neom\u2019s green hydrogen project)
    by providing R&D to reduce costs and increase efficiency of hydrogen technologies.
    Ultimately, it aims to position Saudi Arabia as a global leader in clean hydrogen
    production and utilization"
